pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$base"
notes: 痛点 30 秒：签合同的人往往最没有议价能力。右边三条不是编的，全部摘自我们项目里的示例合同。
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [70, 44, 220, 18]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 01 · 痛点
  - elementId: statement
    elementType: text
    bounds: [66, 84, 470, 150]
    content:
      fontSize: 33
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>签合同的人，</p>
        <p>往往是最没有</p>
        <p>议价能力的人</p>
  - elementId: stmt-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [72, 250, 72, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$brass"}
  - elementId: stmt-sub
    elementType: text
    bounds: [70, 272, 440, 52]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$muted"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>押金、违约金、竞业限制、自动续费……</p>
        <p>不利条款总是写得像"行业惯例"。</p>
  - elementId: q1-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [540, 88, 3, 82]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$brass"}
  - elementId: q1-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [558, 88, 336, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$wine"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>"无论任何原因退租，押金均不予退还。"</p>
  - elementId: q1-src
    elementType: text
    bounds: [558, 148, 336, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: —— 租房合同示例
  - elementId: q2-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [540, 208, 3, 82]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$brass"}
  - elementId: q2-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [558, 208, 336, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$wine"
      lineHeight: 1.5
